{"seq":1,"slug":"why-neural-rendering","title":"为何神经渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-rendering-nerf-gaussian/foundations/why-neural-rendering","wordCount":1656,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何神经渲染\">为何神经渲染</h1><p>一名建模师为一款游戏制作一栋老房子，要花数天搭网格、UV 展开、手绘或扫描贴图、再调光照参数。即便如此，凑近看墙皮剥落的细节、透过脏玻璃的折射、毛绒地毯的次表面散射，仍然处处露馅。问题不在于建模师不够努力，而在于传统图形管线的范式：人来描述场景，机器只负责把这份描述投影成像素。当我们手里只有一沓真实照片、却想自由地换视角观看时，这条单向管线就彻底失灵了——它没有从图像反推场景的能力。神经渲染要解决的正是这个反问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>传统渲染是一个前向函数：给定场景参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>（几何、材质、光照）和相机位姿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>，渲染器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 输出图像 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = R(\\theta, \\pi)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这个函数通常不可微，也无法反过来从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>。神经渲染的关键一步是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 改造成<strong>可微分</strong>的，于是可以用梯度下降反解场景：固定一批已知位姿下拍到的真实图像 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{I_i\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，优化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 使渲染结果逼近它们。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∥</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta^* = \\arg\\min_\\theta \\sum_i \\big\\| R(\\theta, \\pi_i) - I_i \\big\\|^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.556em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.556em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 556 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\nM367 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M410 15 H367 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.404em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.556em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.556em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 556 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\nM367 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M410 15 H367 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.054em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.3029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 既可以是一个神经网络的权重（隐式表示），也可以是一堆显式图元的参数（如高斯椭球）。两条路线在本 hub 后续章节分别展开，但它们共享上面这个优化框架。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[传统图形管线] --&gt; B[人工建模 theta] --&gt; C[前向渲染 R] --&gt; D[图像 I]&#10;  E[神经渲染] --&gt; F[真实照片 Ii + 相机位姿 pi_i]&#10;  F --&gt; G[可微渲染 R&lt;br/&gt;逐像素求梯度]&#10;  G --&gt; H[反向传播更新 theta]&#10;  H --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; J[收敛后&lt;br/&gt;任意新视角渲染]\">flowchart TD\n  A[传统图形管线] --&gt; B[人工建模 theta] --&gt; C[前向渲染 R] --&gt; D[图像 I]\n  E[神经渲染] --&gt; F[真实照片 Ii + 相机位姿 pi_i]\n  F --&gt; G[可微渲染 R&lt;br/&gt;逐像素求梯度]\n  G --&gt; H[反向传播更新 theta]\n  H --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; J[收敛后&lt;br/&gt;任意新视角渲染]</pre><p>下表把两种范式的取舍摆在一起对比。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统图形管线</th>\n<th>神经渲染</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>场景来源</td>\n<td>人工建模 / 扫描</td>\n<td>从照片自动反解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渲染函数</td>\n<td>前向、通常不可微</td>\n<td>可微、可被梯度下降反解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真实感天花板</td>\n<td>受限于建模与材质工艺</td>\n<td>受限于照片质量与表示容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新视角自由度</td>\n<td>完全自由（已有完整几何）</td>\n<td>在拍摄覆盖范围内自由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编辑性</td>\n<td>强（显式几何可直接改）</td>\n<td>较弱（隐式表示难局部编辑）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型耗时</td>\n<td>建模数天、渲染可离线</td>\n<td>训练数秒到数小时、渲染实时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可微分渲染是第一性原理\">可微分渲染是第一性原理</h2><p>让渲染可微，听起来只是工程细节，实则是整个领域的奠基思想。一旦渲染管线的每一步——采样、积分、合成——都对场景参数可导，场景表示就不再需要人来设计，而是变成一个能被数据训练出来的对象。这和深度学习把特征工程交给反向传播，是同一种思想迁移到图形学。</p>\n<p>难点在于「可见性」和「离散采样」这两处天然不可微。光线打到哪个表面、哪些图元遮挡哪些，本质是离散选择；对图像平面的逐像素采样也是离散的。不同路线用不同手段绕开：体渲染用连续的密度场和软透明度（alpha）把硬遮挡软化成可导的加权积分，详见 <a href=\"../nerf/volume-rendering\">体渲染</a>；高斯泼溅则用带 alpha 的椭球溅射加可微光栅化，详见 <a href=\"../gaussian-splatting/differentiable-rasterization\">可微光栅化</a>。两者殊途同归，都是为了让那条优化曲线走得通。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么-2020-年后才爆发\">为什么 2020 年后才爆发</h2><p>神经渲染的概念并不新——体渲染积分早在 1980 年代就用于医学可视化。真正引爆这个领域的是三股力量在 2020 年前后汇合：一是 GPU 算力与自动微分框架（PyTorch / CUDA）成熟，让逐像素求几百万次梯度变得可行；二是多视图几何工具链（COLMAP 等 SfM 软件）能稳定地从随手拍的照片估出相机位姿，为优化提供输入，详见 <a href=\"novel-view-synthesis\">新视角合成</a>；三是 NeRF 这篇 2020 年的工作证明了一个朴素的 MLP 加位置编码就能记住整个场景的辐射场，把质量推到了照片级。</p>\n<p>此后节奏极快：2022 年 Instant-NGP 用多分辨率哈希网格把训练从数天压缩到数秒；2023 年 SIGGRAPH 上的 3D 高斯泼溅（发表于 ACM TOG）彻底解决了实时渲染，在消费级 GPU 上做到 1080p 数百 FPS；到 2026 年，方向已转向动态场景、生成式 3D 与大规模重建。这条加速曲线背后，是「显式表示」逐渐压过「纯隐式 MLP」的趋势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"它不是什么\">它不是什么</h2><p>把边界划清楚同样重要，否则容易把神经渲染和邻近领域混为一谈。</p>\n<p>神经渲染不是图像生成。扩散模型从噪声生成一张 2D 图，它不保证多视角之间的 3D 一致性；神经渲染重建的是一个真正的 3D 场景，从任何角度看都自洽。两者会在生成式 3D 里联手——用扩散模型当先验来监督 3D 优化，详见 <a href=\"../practice/generative-3d\">生成式 3D</a>——但本体是两回事，扩散模型本身见生成式 AI hub 的 <a href=\"../../generative-ai/diffusion-models/diffusion-theory\">扩散理论</a>。</p>\n<p>神经渲染也不是世界模型。世界模型预测「如果我这样动，世界会怎样变」，强调可交互的动力学 rollout；神经渲染（哪怕是动态版本）渲染的是被动重建或回放的场景，不建模因果干预。这条边界详见世界模型 hub 的相关讨论。</p>\n<p>理解了这些，再去看每一条具体技术路线，就不会迷失在算法细节里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>传统图形管线是「人描述场景、机器投影成像」的单向前向过程，无法从照片反推可渲染的 3D 场景。</li>\n<li>神经渲染把渲染函数改造成可微分的，于是能用梯度下降从真实照片反解场景参数——这是整个领域的第一性原理。</li>\n<li>场景参数既可是神经网络权重（隐式），也可是显式图元（如高斯椭球），但都共享同一个「最小化渲染误差」的优化框架。</li>\n<li>可见性与离散采样天然不可微，体渲染用软 alpha 积分、高斯泼溅用可微光栅化分别绕开。</li>\n<li>2020 年后爆发是算力、SfM 工具链、NeRF 三者汇合的结果；2023 年高斯泼溅解决实时性，2026 年转向动态与生成。</li>\n<li>神经渲染既非 2D 图像生成、也非可交互世界模型，边界要划清。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>任务定义与数据来源：<a href=\"novel-view-synthesis\">新视角合成</a></li>\n<li>方法地图与路线取舍：<a href=\"neural-rendering-spectrum\">神经渲染谱系</a></li>\n<li>可微渲染的两种实现：<a href=\"../nerf/volume-rendering\">体渲染</a>、<a href=\"../gaussian-splatting/differentiable-rasterization\">可微光栅化</a></li>\n<li>跨库：相机几何与特征匹配的底层视觉基础见 <a href=\"../../computer-vision/image-fundamentals/feature-extraction\">特征提取</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何神经渲染","id":"为何神经渲染"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可微分渲染是第一性原理","id":"可微分渲染是第一性原理"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么 2020 年后才爆发","id":"为什么-2020-年后才爆发"},{"level":2,"text":"它不是什么","id":"它不是什么"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"新视角合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-rendering-nerf-gaussian/foundations/novel-view-synthesis"}}